{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"555-timer-calculator UI copy.fields.formulaNote","detected_language":"vi","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"555-timer-calculator.copy.fields.formulaNote","keys":["555-timer-calculator.copy.fields.formulaNote"],"locale":"vi","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Đơn vị dao động không ổn định: tHIGH = ZXQPH0000QXZ × (RA + RB) × C; tLOW = ZXQPH0001QXZ × RB × C; T = tHIGH + tLOW; f = ZXQPH0002QXZ/T; Chu kỳ làm việc hình sóng đầu ra = tHIGH/T. Đơn ổn định: tPULSE ≈ ZXQPH0003QXZ × R × C.","record_id":"8eca31684cbe5958ef4d1b9127afb73ac5ae18354d124322eca091e124038f67","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":3.639650939250032,"source":"Astable oscillator: tHIGH = 0.693 × (RA + RB) × C; tLOW = 0.693 × RB × C; T = tHIGH + tLOW; f = 1/T; Output waveform duty cycle = tHIGH/T. Monostable one-shot: tPULSE ≈ 1.1 × R × C.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"e612fe9d66f1520994907e50a330386216783c2404b33e0dbfbe6155b86896eb","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Đơn vị dao động không ổn định: tHIGH = 0.693 × (RA + RB) × C; tLOW = 0.693 × RB × C; T = tHIGH + tLOW; f = 1/T; Chu kỳ làm việc hình sóng đầu ra = tHIGH/T. Đơn ổn định: tPULSE ≈ 1.1 × R × C.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
